(A collection typically stores an identifier, text, metadata, and an embedding. A persistent ) Tj
T*
(index writes this data to disk so that the application does not have to rebuild it after every ) Tj
T*
(restart. Updating a document should remove or replace the old chunks for that filename; ) Tj
T*
(otherwise, obsolete passages can continue to surface alongside the new version.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For a small personal library, exact nearest-neighbor search is often practical and simple. ) Tj
T*
(Approximate indexes trade a small amount of search precision for speed on larger corpora. The ) Tj
T*
(right choice depends on collection size, latency, memory, and the cost of a missed result. Index ) Tj
T*
(configuration is an engineering choice, not a guarantee of semantic correctness.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Improve retrieval with evidence) Tj
T*
(Start evaluation with a small set of questions whose supporting pages are known. For each ) Tj
T*
(question, check whether the expected page appears among the top results. This is retrieval ) Tj
T*
(recall. Then inspect whether the passage actually supports the answer. A useful search can fail ) Tj
T*
(because the PDF was extracted poorly, the question is vague, the chunk splits the evidence, or ) Tj
T*
(the embedding model misses a domain-specific term.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Hybrid retrieval combines semantic similarity with exact lexical search. It can help when ) Tj
T*
(documents contain product codes, names, or exact phrases that embeddings alone may not rank ) Tj
T*
(highly. Reranking applies a second model to reorder a smaller candidate set. Both techniques add ) Tj
T*
(complexity and should be introduced when a measured failure justifies them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Semantic search is a retrieval tool, not a replacement for sources. Keeping passages and ) Tj
T*
(citation metadata together gives readers a path back to the original evidence. A transparent ) Tj
T*
(interface that shows the filename and page alongside an answer makes it easier to notice missing ) Tj
T*
(or mismatched context.) Tj
T*
